{
  "source": "Prompts/when-you-need-more-7.mp4",
  "duration": 192.725625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.02,
      "end": 5.36,
      "text": "For many tasks, open your AI app, ask your question, and keep the conversation going."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.94,
      "end": 8.5,
      "text": "But some tasks ask more of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.2,
      "end": 16.78,
      "text": "You might need help working through a complicated plan, weighing several options, or investigating information across different sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.38,
      "end": 22.56,
      "text": "Depending on the app and your subscription, you have three other choices to handle that complexity."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.2,
      "end": 25.62,
      "text": "The model, thinking, and research."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.62,
      "end": 30.38,
      "text": "You won't need to change them every time, but knowing what they do helps you get a better answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.28,
      "end": 38.24,
      "text": "These advanced settings aren't magic. They are simply different ways to instruct the AI to work harder on your specific problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.88,
      "end": 43.8,
      "text": "Let's look at the first option, which focuses on the underlying engine of the app itself."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.56,
      "end": 47.3,
      "text": "This board shows what changing the model does."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.1,
      "end": 53.92,
      "text": "An LLM powers the app's answers. Choosing a model selects which LLM engine to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.92,
      "end": 62.06,
      "text": "Start with the default. On the left, the everyday model is for simple tasks. Ask, suggest a funny movie to watch tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.56,
      "end": 72.2,
      "text": "On the right, the more capable model is for demanding tasks. Ask, help me plan a summer business, including costs, pricing, and how many customers I'll need."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.06,
      "end": 80.34,
      "text": "Upgrading the model is about changing the actual entity that processes your prompt, giving you a heavier duty engine when the details require it."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.34,
      "end": 87.98,
      "text": "We just changed the engine. Now let's look at a different tool, one that controls the amount of time the AI is allowed to work."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.74,
      "end": 96.06,
      "text": "This next board illustrates thinking. This setting strictly changes how much time the AI spends working through the task."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.6,
      "end": 104.1,
      "text": "On the left, with less thinking, the AI spends less time. Ask, turn these notes from our group meeting into a clear checklist."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.1,
      "end": 112.92,
      "text": "On the right, more thinking forces the AI to weigh options for analysis. Ask, help us divide this project among four people."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.3,
      "end": 117.44,
      "text": "We have one week, different schedules, and only two people know how to edit video."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.2,
      "end": 127.9,
      "text": "By increasing the thinking time, you ensure the AI forces itself to show its work, allowing it to untangle complex, multi-step logic before it generates the final response."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.9,
      "end": 136.3,
      "text": "Sometimes extra time and a better engine aren't enough. You need the AI to look completely outside its own internal knowledge base."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.98,
      "end": 145.14,
      "text": "Our final board defines research. While a regular chat looks up basic facts, this dedicated mode synthesizes information from different websites."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.26,
      "end": 155.84,
      "text": "On the left, use regular chat just to get an answer. Ask, I live in Dallas. How long would it take me to drive to Texas A&M in College Station versus UT Austin?"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.84,
      "end": 165.84,
      "text": "On the right, use deep research to build a report that shows sources. Ask, I want to study physics and am considering Texas A&M and UT Austin."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.36,
      "end": 172.32,
      "text": "Compare their physics programs, undergraduate research opportunities, admissions requirements, and costs. Show your sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.48,
      "end": 182.16,
      "text": "Research is the correct choice when your primary goal is to verify accuracy and pull facts from multiple independent external sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.76,
      "end": 189.22,
      "text": "Remember our three settings. Model, thinking, and research. Use them when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
